00000,"endDate":1740142800000,"tbdDate":null,"city":"Carnaxide","host":"The european Network on Extreme fiRe behaviOr (NERO) COST Action","contactPerson":"Dominika Leskow-Czyzewska","contactEmail":"training@eumetsat.int","contactUrl":"https://nero-network.eu/news/1st-nero-winter-school-fire-spread-behavior-reconstruction","description":"The european Network on Extreme fiRe behaviOr (NERO) is pleased to announce its 1st Winter School, designed to advance knowledge and skills in reconstructing wildfire spread and estimating fire behavior descriptorsm such as the rate of spread. This hands-on training aligns with NERO’s mission to unite researchers and practitioners in understanding and mitigating wildfire risks.","country":{"id":"PT","name":"PORTUGAL","region":"RA-VI","type":"Member State"},"learningOutcome":"Participants will gain:\n- Theoretical Knowledge: Remote sensing principles and data applications.\n- Data Insights: Understanding satellite and airborne data sources and products.\n- Practical Skills: Tools like Python and QGIS to reconstruct fire spread evolution and estimate wildfire behavior.\n\nBy the end of the Winter School, participants will be equipped to independently analyze past wildfire events, contributing to NERO’s broader objectives.","summary":null,"content":null,"targetAudience":"Limited to 20 NERO members. Priority will be given to young researchers, female researchers, and practitioners. Additionally, geographical and gender balance, and balance between researchers and practitioners will be ensured.","registrationHowto":"To have a look at the whole announcement, follow the link: https://nero-network.eu/news/1st-nero-winter-school-fire-spread-behavior-reconstruction.","registrationEndDate":1737503940000,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":9984,"name":"Dominika Leskow-Czyzewska ","email":"Dominika.Leskow-Czyzewska@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"EM","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":n