s and services. \n\nThe Workshop will provide a platform to discuss current and future user needs to consider in the evolution of EUMETSAT products and services. \n\nAt the end of the workshop, we hope to be able to identify a few co-development projects to support interested users in jointly developing operational applications using EUMETSAT data. The European Weather Cloud (EWC) could be used as collaborating space.  \n\nPlease note that the event will start on Monday, 09:00 am and end on Tuesday around lunchtime.","country":{"id":"DE","name":"GERMANY","region":"RA-VI","type":"Member State"},"learningOutcome":"","summary":"SALGEE ( Satellite Applications in Land surface analyses Group for Eastern Europe) and the LSA SAF are jointly organising the 2024 LSA SAF User Workshop on \"Monitoring Drought Impa","content":null,"targetAudience":"Scientists working on monitoring of various vegetation, agriculture, drought and wild-fire topics as well experts concerned with the implementation of related monitoring routines and the provision of consultancy to downstream users.","registrationHowto":"By invitation only.","registrationEndDate":null,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5847,"name":"Christine Traeger Chatterjee","email":"christine.traeger@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"EM","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":103,"value":"Workshop"},"attendance":{"id":2,"value":"By invitation only"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":null,"format":"RESIDENCE","attendeeCount":37,"external":false,"previouslyConfirmed":false,"initiative":[{"id":50,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":true}],"trainingPartner":[{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":false}],"programmes":[],"language":[{"id":3,"value":"English"