","type":"Member State"},"learningOutcome":"Skills in monitoring, forecasting and warning of high impact summer storms.\nSkills in using new satellite capabilities through FCI and LI on MTG-I1 in summer storm cases. \nCommunication skills in high impact weather events. \nParticipation in small co-creation projects.","summary":null,"content":null,"targetAudience":"Operational Meteorologists from Scandinavia, with invitations to forecasters from the Baltic States and Ireland.","registrationHowto":"Please contact your national point of contact for training for more information on the nomination and application process. ","registrationEndDate":1706659200000,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5842,"name":"Vesa Nietosvaara","email":"vesa.nietosvaara@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"EM","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":101,"value":"Course"},"attendance":{"id":2,"value":"By invitation only"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":null,"format":"RESIDENCE","attendeeCount":37,"external":false,"previouslyConfirmed":false,"initiative":[{"id":60,"value":"EUMETSAT & NMS","visible":false}],"trainingPartner":[{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":false}],"programmes":[],"language":[{"id":3,"value":"English","iso639":"en"}],"regions":[{"id":7,"value":"VI Europe"}],"qualification":[{"id":8,"value":"PWS: Weather Broadcasters and Communicators"},{"id":17,"value":"Satellite Skills and Knowledge"}],"eumDataApplications":[{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":18,"title":"Weather","identifier":"dataApplication"}],"eumDataAccessTypes":[],"eumSatelliteMissions":[{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":1,"name":"Metop"},{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":2,"name":"MSG"},{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":3,"name":"MTG"}],"eumSensors":[]},{"id":2411,"created":1714380965000,"updated":null,"title":"MeteoSwiss warning system","titleNative":"MeteoSwiss warning system","startDate":1716462000000,"endDate":1716465600000,"tbdDate":null,"city":null,"host":"EUMETCAL","contactPerson":"EUMETCAL","contactEmail":"info@eumetcal.eu","contactUrl":"https://eumetcal.eu/en/ui#/page/Newsitem41","description":"\nThe Swiss Federal Institute of Meteorology and Climatology, MeteoSwiss, plays a critical role in safeguarding the Swiss population and infrastructure through its weather warning system. Following the devastating impact of Storm Lothar in December 1999, MeteoSwiss has continuously enhanced its warning capabilities, currently encompassing 7 weather phenomena across 159 warning regions.\n \nIn this presentation, we will delve into the specificities of the current MeteoSwiss warning system, elucidating our strategic approach to warnings and our collaborative efforts with federal institutes and regional authorities. Furthermore, we will offer insights on how forecasters navigate various warning scenarios through compelling case studies. Lastly, we will provide a glimpse into the future with an overview of automatic warning propositions designed to distill information from our regional ensemble model, enhancing the efficacy and efficiency of our warning dissemination efforts.  ","country":{"id":"--","name":"ONLINE","region":null,"type":"Other"},"learningOutcome":null,"summary":null,"content":null,"targetAudience":null,"registrationHowto":"https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/55078f5f-538c-498f-876f-7ac62c70862e@396b9e20-59c1-4cf1-bc03-d43fd5759427","registrationEndDate":null,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5854,"name":"Tomislav Marekovic","email":"marekovic@cirus.dhz.hr","agency":"","country":"HR","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":16,"value":"Eumetcal"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastA