tations about interesting cases they have collaboratively created during the weeks preceding this workshop.","country":{"id":"EE","name":"ESTONIA","region":"RA-VI","type":"Member State"},"learningOutcome":"Further practice in forecasting warm season convection using satellite imagery together with other observations as well as numerical weather prediction output, through case study work, simulations and group discussions with other experts. \n\nUse of the new capabilities of FCI and LI in operational nowcasting convection environment.\n\nExchange ideas and suggestions with colleagues from other weather services.","summary":"This training workshop is intended for the operational meteorologists from Estonia, Latvia, Lithuania and Poland, with invitations to meteorologists from Ukraine.  The participants","content":null,"targetAudience":"Operational meteorologists from Estonia, Latvia, Lithuania, Poland and Ukraine.","registrationHowto":"Contact your national point of contact for training for more information on the nomination and application process.","registrationEndDate":1709164800000,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5842,"name":"Vesa Nietosvaara","email":"vesa.nietosvaara@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"EM","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":101,"value":"Course"},"attendance":{"id":2,"value":"By invitation only"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":null,"format":"RESIDENCE","attendeeCount":17,"external":false,"previouslyConfirmed":false,"initiative":[{"id":50,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":true},{"id":70,"value":"NHMS","visible":true}],"trainingPartner":[{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":false}],"programmes":[],"language":[{"id":3,"value":"English","iso639":"en"}],"regions