eadquarters in Darmstadt, 4-8 December. ","country":{"id":"--","name":"ONLINE","region":null,"type":"Other"},"learningOutcome":"•\tImprove skills in diagnosing relevant weather phenomena using weather satellite products;\n•\tImproved skills in correctly interpreting satellite images; \n•\tIncreased awareness on the potential of modern satellite products in the forecasting process.\n","summary":"At this course, we will work through seven essential meteorological topics in live sessions as well as asynchronous learning in between the live sessions. You will learn to use the","content":null,"targetAudience":"Operational Meteorologists and Trainers in Europe. ","registrationHowto":"The applications are open. You can apply by filling in the application form at \n\nhttps://www.surveymonkey.com/r/SMASI23-application-test\n\nThe deadline for registrations is 27 August, and successful applicants will be informed by the first week of September 2023. ","registrationEndDate":1693094400000,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5842,"name":"Vesa Nietosvaara","email":"vesa.nietosvaara@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"EM","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":101,"value":"Course"},"attendance":{"id":1,"value":"Open"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":null,"format":"BLENDED","attendeeCount":0,"external":false,"previouslyConfirmed":false,"initiative":[{"id":40,"value":"EUMeTrain","visible":true},{"id":50,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":true}],"trainingPartner":[{"id":16,"value":"Eumetcal","visible":false},{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":false}],"programmes":[],"language":[{"id":3,"value":"English","iso639":"en"}],"regions":[{"id":7,"value":"VI Europe"}],"qualification":[{"id":17,"value":"Satellite Skills and Knowledge"}],"eumDataApplications":[{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":7,"title":"Large-scale and synoptic systems","identifier":"dataApplication"},{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":18,"title":"Weather","identifier":"dataApplication"}],"eumDataAccessTypes":[{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":19,"name":"EUMETView"}],"eumSatelliteMissions":[{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":1,"name":"Metop"},{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":2,"name":"MSG"},{"eventMetadataGroup":{"id":1,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"id":3,"name":"MTG"}],"eumSensors":[]},{"id":2331,"created":1695327258000,"updated":1697133993000,"title":"Regional Focus Group of the Americas and the Caribbean: October 2023 Weather and Climate Discussion","titleNative":"Regional Focus Group of the Americas and the Caribbean: October 2023 Weather and Climate Discussion","startDate":1697637600000,"endDate":1697643000000,"tbdDate":null,"city":null,"host":"NOAA, CIRA, and CoEs: Costa Rica/Barbados/Argentina/Brazil","contactPerson":"Bernie Connell","contactEmail":"Bernie.Connell@colostate.edu","contactUrl":"https://rammb2.cira.colostate.edu/training/rmtc/focusgroup/","description":"These monthly weather and climate discussions are bilingual (English and Spanish) and focus on WMO regions III (South America) and IV (Central America/Caribbean). The sessions highlight the use and interpretation of satellite imagery and products for meteorological applications, using SLIDER (http://rammb-slider.cira.colostate.edu) for imagery. Anyone with an interest is welcome to attend.\n\nGoToWebinar is the software platform used.  The session will begin at 14:00 UTC, with the webinar opening 10 minutes earlier (13:50 UTC) for those who wish to check their microphone.","country":{"id":"--","name":"ONLINE","region":null,"type":"Other"},"learningOutcome":"Satellite imagery and products real-time applications","summary":null,"content":null,"targetAu