902400000,"endDate":1695906000000,"tbdDate":null,"city":"","host":null,"contactPerson":"Noemi Marsico","contactEmail":"training@eumetsat.int","contactUrl":"https://training.eumetsat.int/course/view.php?id=436","description":"This series of 30-minute sessions is designed to support the transition from the EUMETSAT Data Centre in favor of the Data Store. This particular session focuses on using the Swagger UI to interact with the EUMETSAT Data Access APIs. Due to the reduction of products in the Data Centre, this session will be a great opportunity to remove any technical challenges in using the Data Access Client Services (EUMDAC) and engage users in discussion with EUMETSAT experts and colleagues. Please, read more information about the transition here: https://eumetsatspace.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/EUM/blog/2023/03/22/1965359114/Switching+the+data+access+from+the+Data+Centre+to+the+Data+Store+for+faster+delivery+times EXT.\n\nThe session will cover 30 minutes approximately.\n\nWe encourage you to post your questions on sli.do ( https://app.sli.do/event/flsdivtc) so that we can adapt the content of the next session to answer them!\n\nThe sessions are open to all and address a wide range of attendees, from service providers to scientists and forecasters. Registration via Zoom is required.","country":{"id":"--","name":"ONLINE","region":null,"type":"Other"},"learningOutcome":"Users should be able to use the Swagger UI to browse, search for, and download collections and products of interest;\n\nUsers should be able to access the Swagger UI through the EUMETSAT pages;\n\nUsers should know where to find resources to support the use of the new data access services; \n\nUsers should know where to go for further help in using the new data access services","summary":"This series of 30-minute sessions is designed to support the transition from the EUMETSAT Data Centre in favor of the Data Store. This particular session focuses on using the Swagg","content":null,"targetAudienc