alysis and prediction of deep convection and associated phenomena. The experts will exchange experiences and feedback on practices and operational and experimental applications aimed at convection processes in the atmosphere.\r\nThe event will be delivered in hybrid mode, allowing an online attendance. \r\n","country":{"id":"HU","name":"HUNGARY","region":"RA-VI","type":"Member State"},"learningOutcome":"","summary":"The main objectives of the workshop are to gather experts in the field of satellite meteorology for progression of using satellite data for detection, analysis and prediction of de","content":"The topics of this joint meeting will cover:\r\n\r\n    New imager channels and products;\r\n    Data visualisation for the new generation satellites;\r\n    Satellite vertical profiles;\r\n    Lightning observations from space;\r\n    Research  Operations conversations;\r\n    Multi-sensor and integrated approaches;\r\n    Training elements/material","targetAudience":"Researchers, developers and operational users, for exchanging experiences and feedback on practices and operational and experimental applications aimed at convection processes in the atmosphere.","registrationHowto":"","registrationEndDate":1652490000000,"fees":"","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5842,"name":"Vesa Nietosvaara","email":"vesa.nietosvaara@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"EM","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":103,"value":"Workshop"},"attendance":{"id":2,"value":"By invitation only"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":"DEFINITE","format":null,"attendeeCount":0,"external":false,"previouslyConfirmed":false,"initiative":[{"id":50,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":true}],"trainingPartner":[],"programmes":[],"language