b Service to customise products to create bespoke data streams that fit their applications, via both GUI and API, as required\r\nUsers should be able to use the Data Tailor Web Service to customise products to mirror existing processing chains that rely on EUMETCast and/or the Data Centre.\r\nUsers should be able to use the EUMETView OMS GUI to: i) discover layers, ii) craft their own views, iii) manipulate and share views, iv) export data from layers as time series, images and animations, and v) link layers to Data Store collections where appropriate.\r\nIn addition to the above, users should be able to use the EUMETView OMS API to i) discover capabilities, ii) exploit the WMS/WCS/WFS endpoints to construct customised data requests.\r\nUsers should know where to find resources to support the use of the new data access services\r\nUsers should know where to go for further help in using the new data access services","summary":"Monthly series of open, online short sessions on the Data Access Services and their usage via GUIs and APIs, answering top questions posted by participants in an open sli.do (event","content":"","targetAudience":"Anyone interested in using the new Data Access Services, especially users of the Data Centre, CODA/CODAREP (and possibly also EUMETCast). ","registrationHowto":"Please register here:  https://eumetsat.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZctdeuvqTwoHtOL_4yAIxzDbPZf-9U_AG2N","registrationEndDate":null,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5841,"name":"Regina Hoefenmayer","email":"regina.hoefenmayer@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"EM","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":101,"value":"Course"},"attendance":{"id":1,"value":"Open"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":