nography, air quality and climate running from October 2021.","content":"In the course we will learn some of the most popular machine learning algorithms applied to retrieval and classification of optical remote sensing images (Sentinel-3 OLCI) for Ocean Colour studies. \r\n\r\nWe will show two examples, one on water quality retrieval and another on optical water type classification using Phyton Jupyter Notebooks and/or MATLAB scripts.","targetAudience":"The short courses are open and address a wide range of attendees, from service providers to young (and less young) scientists and forecasters.","registrationHowto":"Register in advance for this webinar at the course page:\r\n\r\nhttps://training.eumetsat.int/course/view.php?id=425\r\n\r\nAfter registering, you will receive a confirmation email containing information about joining the webinar.","registrationEndDate":null,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5840,"name":"Rosa Ullucci","email":"rosa.ullucci@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"EM","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":101,"value":"Course"},"attendance":{"id":1,"value":"Open"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":"DEFINITE","format":null,"attendeeCount":0,"external":false,"previouslyConfirmed":false,"initiative":[{"id":50,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":true}],"trainingPartner":[],"programmes":[],"language":[{"id":3,"value":"English","iso639":"en"}],"regions":[],"qualification":[],"eumDataApplications":[],"eumDataAccessTypes":[],"eumSatelliteMissions":[],"eumSensors":[]},{"id":2091,"created":1635343922000,"updated":1635345099000,"title":"AOMSUC-11 Training Event","titleNative":"AOMSUC-11 Training Event","startDate":1635381000000,"endDate":1635506100000,"tbdDate":null,"city":"Beijing","host":"CMA Training Centre","contactPerson":"DENG Jingmian","contactEmail":"dengjingmian@cma.gov.cn","contactUrl":"http://www.nsmc.org.cn/conference/fy-suf/2021/index.html#","description":"The workshop is designed to enhance the trainees understanding of the latest development of satellite products of different satellite operators, and improve their knowledge and skills in the application of satellite data in supporting weather analysis, tropical cyclone and environmental monitoring etc.","country":{"id":"CN","name":"CHINA","region":"RA-II","type":"Middle East"},"learningOutcome":"Participants are expected to know more about the satellite data services in CMA, JMA and KMA, and to improve their understanding of the current satellite development. They are also expected to enhance their skill of application of satellite products in weather analysis, tropical cyclone monitoring, and environmental disaster monitoring and so on. Through this training, they will have the opportunity to communicate and share with each other.","summary":null,"content":"Satellite data services provided by satellite operators including CMA, JMA and KMA;","targetAudience":"Satellite meteorologists who have been working for at least one year. ","registrationHowto":"Participants could open the website first and registrate by yourself. The schedule has been displayed on the website and participants could join the meeting on time.","registrationEndDate":1635350400000,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5868,"name":"JI Wenbin","email":"jiwenbin@cma.cn","agency":"","country":"CN","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":1,"value":"VLab Centre of Excellence China-Beijing"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":103,"value":"Workshop"},"attendance":{"id":1,"value":"Open"},"status":{"id":2,"va