sharing and services\r\n- Discuss needs and priorities from experts users in order to define further activities\r\n- Support the preparation of existing and new users on existing and upcoming products from next-generation satellites","country":{"id":"--","name":"ONLINE","region":null,"type":"Other"},"learningOutcome":"- Familiarization with concepts on detection of Fire, related emissions and impacts\r\n- Identify fire signature(s) in data\r\n- Handle products with tools\r\n- Maintain a two-way interaction with users gathering methods and needs","summary":null,"content":"We propose three morning sessions with contributions from data and service providers, existing projects and national services. Confirmed contribution from data and application experts from EUMETSAT, ECMWF, ECMWF-CAMS, EUMETSAT, Satellite Application Facilities, NOAA (US), Pau Costa Foundation (ES), Pyrolife (NL), IPMA (Pt), SMHI (SE) , MeteoFrance (F), Portugal Civil Protection (PT), CIMA Foundation (I), HNMS (GR), Aristotle-eENHSP (EU).\r\nEach session has a discussion part and 1h30 data discovery in the afternoon.","targetAudience":"Service providers (Forecasters, Fire monitoring)","registrationHowto":"Registration via https://eumetsat.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMrdumorDouH9GsuneBag7ATch7z8IkK7DA","registrationEndDate":null,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":4858,"name":"Elena Ebert","email":"Elena.Ebert@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"DE","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":103,"value":"Workshop"},"attendance":{"id":1,"value":"Open"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":"DEFINITE","format":null,"attendeeCount":0,"external":false,"previouslyConfirmed":false,"initiative":[{"id":180,"value":"Copernicus","visible":true}],"trainingPartner":[{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":false}],"programmes":[],"language":[{"id":3,"value":"English","iso639":"en"}],"regions":[{"id":7,"value":"VI Europe"}],"qualification":[{"id":17,"value":"Satellite Skills and Knowledge"}],"eumDataApplications":[],"eumDataAccessTypes":[],"eumSatelliteMissions":[],"eumSensors":[]},{"id":2017,"created":1615989750000,"updated":1616143732000,"title":"User workshop and training on existing and new generation earth observation based products for wildfire monitoring and forecast","titleNative":"User workshop and training on existing and new generation earth observation based products for wildfire monitoring and forecast","startDate":1621900800000,"endDate":1622073600000,"tbdDate":null,"city":"","host":"","contactPerson":"Federico Fierli","contactEmail":"Federico.Fierli@eumetsat.int","contactUrl":"https://eumetsat.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMrdumorDouH9GsuneBag7ATch7z8IkK7DA","description":"","country":{"id":"--","name":"ONLINE","region":null,"type":"Other"},"learningOutcome":"","summary":null,"content":"With this event we aim to: (1) inform and consult the European services working on wildfires; (2) present initiatives on data access and knowledge sharing;  (3) gather needs and priorities from experts users in order to define further activities driven by users needs; (4) support the Users preparation for the new generation Meteosat and European Polar System satellites.\r\nWe propose three morning sessions with contributions from data and service providers, existing projects and groups on wildfires and national services. ","targetAudience":"Services in Europe with mandate/ role to monitor forecast fires.","registrationHowto":"In order to apply, please go to https://eumetsat.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJMrdumorDouH9GsuneBag7ATch7z8IkK7DA and register.","registrationEndDate":1622073600000,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":4858,"name":"Elena Ebert","email":"Elena.Ebert@eumetsat.int","agency":"","count