sis of the Jet Streams of the Southern Hemisphere - With emphasis on South America","titleNative":"La Dinámica y Análisis de las Corrientes en Chorro (Jets) del Hemisferio Sur  Con énfasis en Sudamérica","startDate":1615388400000,"endDate":1615395600000,"tbdDate":null,"city":"Online","host":"NOAA/WPC International Desk","contactPerson":"Michel Davison","contactEmail":"michel.davison@noaa.gov","contactUrl":"https://attendee.gotowebinar.com/register/3345383288047428111","description":"Jet streams and their impact on dynamic processes are a critical element that the meteorological analyst and forecaster must always consider during the evaluation of the atmosphere. In this special session we will explore conceptual models and the characteristics of jets in upper levels of the southern hemisphere; concentrating on the two branches of the polar jet, the subtropical, the polar night jet and the subequatorial.  GoToWebinar is used for both images and voice through the Internet.  ","country":null,"learningOutcome":"Utilize conceptual models, numerical weather model output, and satellite imagery to identify jet stream features.","summary":null,"content":"Las corrientes en chorro (jets) y su impacto en los procesos dinámicos son un elemento crítico que el analista y pronosticador meteorológico tienen que siempre considerar durante la evaluación de la atmosfera.  En esta sesión especial exploraremos modelos conceptuales y las características de los jets en niveles superiores del hemisferio sur; concentrándonos en los dos ramales del jet polar, el subtropical, el jet de la noche polar y el subecuatorial ","targetAudience":"Forecasters, Students, Researchers, Trainers","registrationHowto":"https://attendee.gotowebinar.com/register/3345383288047428111 \r\n","registrationEndDate":null,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5859,"name":"Jose Galvez","email":"jose.galvez@colostate.edu","agency":"","country":"US","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":18,"value":"NOAA"},"use