 the course, the participans will be able to:\r\n\r\n- Analyze satellite data interpretation to monitor and detect severe weather.\r\n- Be a proficient user in RGB images.\r\n- Use the satellite data in the forecasting process. \r\n- Access the online training resources such as COMET and ASMET.","summary":null,"content":"The course consists of daily satellite image analyses and weather forecasts in PUMA laboratory, meteorological simulation exercises and individual presentations. ","targetAudience":"Operational forecasters in National Meteorological Services in Africa. ","registrationHowto":"The classroom invitations are sent after the online course by the end of September 2018. \r\n","registrationEndDate":null,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":5842,"name":"Vesa Nietosvaara","email":"vesa.nietosvaara@eumetsat.int","agency":"","country":"EM","programme":"","trainingPartner":{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT"},"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":101,"value":"Course"},"attendance":{"id":2,"value":"By invitation only"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":"DEFINITE","format":null,"attendeeCount":0,"external":false,"previouslyConfirmed":true,"initiative":[{"id":90,"value":"VLab","visible":true}],"trainingPartner":[{"id":8,"value":"VLab Centre of Excellence Kenya","visible":false},{"id":15,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":false}],"programmes":[],"language":[{"id":3,"value":"English","iso639":"en"}],"regions":[{"id":1,"value":"I Africa"}],"qualification":[{"id":17,"value":"Satellite Skills and Knowledge"}],"eumDataApplications":[],"eumDataAccessTypes":[],"eumSatelliteMissions":[],"eumSensors":[]},{"id":1725,"created":1541406607000,"updated":null,"title":"Monitoring Atmospheric Composition ","titleNative":"Monitoring Atmospheric Composition ","startDate":15413760