 institutions in the use of CM SAF products for ope","content":"This is a blended training, composed of an online phase and a classroom phase. The online phase covers background information about the data, data formats and tools, that is needed to successfully work with satellite based climate information and specifically with the products that are subject of this course. In addition, the mini project that the participant would like to work during the classroom phase in Riga, should to be defined during the online phase.\r\n","targetAudience":"Climatologists at all levels of experience in the use of satellite data for climate applications from NMHSs, universities and other institutions applying climate data. A profound knowledge of the English language is mandatory for participation.","registrationHowto":"You can apply for this course using the following link: http://training.eumetsat.int/course/view.php?id=158. \r\n\r\nFor the classroom phase, EUMETSAT supports a limited number of participants with travel or/and accommodation upon request. \r\n\r\nParticipants are advised to have personal travel and medical insurance. Neither EUMETSAT nor LEGMC are responsible for any incident that could occur during the course.","registrationEndDate":1520553600000,"fees":"No","awardGranted":null,"creator":{"id":2829,"name":"Joana Betencourt ","email":"Joana.Betencourt@eumetsat.int","agency":"EUMETSAT","country":"DE","programme":"EUMETSAT","trainingPartner":null,"userIdentifier":null,"blocked":null,"lastAccess":null,"webGroup":null,"profile":null,"aclRoleIds":null,"aclGroupIds":null},"approver":null,"leadTrainer":null,"aclGroup":{"id":2,"name":"EUMETSAT"},"statusUpdate":null,"eventType":{"id":101,"value":"Course"},"attendance":{"id":1,"value":"Open"},"status":{"id":2,"value":"Confirmed"},"condition":"DEFINITE","format":null,"attendeeCount":0,"external":false,"previouslyConfirmed":true,"initiative":[{"id":50,"value":"EUMETSAT","visible":true}],"trainingPartner":[{"id":15,"value":"EU